       <i class=\"fas fa-gem mr-2\"></i> Pilih Paket Premium\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"p-8\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-6\">Fitur Eksklusif</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check text-[#d4af37] mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Proyek tidak terbatas</span></span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check text-[#d4af37] mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><span class=\"font-semibold\">100 GB</span> penyimpanan cloud</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check text-[#d4af37] mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span>Dukungan <span class=\"font-semibold\">prioritas 24/7</span></span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check text-[#d4af37] mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span>Analitik <span class=\"font-semibold\">lengkap + AI</span></span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check text-[#d4af37] mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><span class=\"font-semibold\">4x</span> konsultasi prioritas/bulan</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check text-[#d4af37] mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span>Integrasi API <span class=\"font-semibold\">tanpa batas</span></span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Paket Enterprise -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden card-shadow transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n            <div class=\"p-8 border-b border-gray-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Enterprise</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">Solusi custom untuk perusahaan besar dengan kebutuhan khusus.</p>\n                <div class=\"mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\n                        <span class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Custom</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2\">Harga sesuai kebutuhan dan skala perusahaan</p>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"w-full py-3 px-6 bg-gray-900 text-white font-medium rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-800 transition duration-300\">\n                    Hubungi Sales\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"p-8\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-6\">Fitur Enterprise</h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-star text-purple-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                        <span>Semua fitur Premium</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-star text-purple-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                        <span>Infrastruktur khusus (on-premise/cloud)</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-star text-purple-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                        <span>Tim dedicated support</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-star text-purple-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                        <span>Pelatihan & onboarding khusus</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-star text-purple-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                        <span>SLA 99.9% uptime</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-star text-purple-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                        <span>Integrasi dengan sistem internal</span>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- FAQ Section -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-20 p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl card-shadow\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-elegant text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-10\">Pertanyaan <span class=\"text-[#d4af37]\">Umum</span></h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"feature-hover\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2 flex items-center\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-[#d4af37] mr-3\"></i>\n                        Bisakah saya upgrade paket nanti?\n                    </h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Tentu! Anda dapat meningkatkan paket kapan saja. Hanya bayar selisih harga untuk sisa periode berlangganan.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"feature-hover\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2 flex items-center\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-[#d4af37] mr-3\"></i>\n                        Apakah ada kontrak jangka panjang?\n                    </h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Semua paket bulanan dapat dibatalkan kapan saja. Paket tahunan memberikan diskon 20% dengan